1
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:40,670
Young Master,

2
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:42,690
I have the results of the investigation

3
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,250
into the missing dock workers.

4
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:45,850
It's exactly as you thought.

5
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:48,110
I asked around
the Qingtian Gang's territory.

6
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:51,060
Recently, a group of people
did have inexplicable accidents.

7
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:51,990
Here is the list.

8
00:00:54,510 --> 00:00:55,970
The beggar on East Street,

9
00:00:56,010 --> 00:00:57,410
the orphan at the chapel,

10
00:00:58,150 --> 00:00:59,750
and the old mute at the ferry.

11
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:02,300
They really know how to pick them.

12
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:03,860
These people are just like Zheng.

13
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:05,459
No one cares even if they die.

14
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,380
Our people also found something else.

15
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:08,500
In these places,

16
00:01:08,690 --> 00:01:09,890
they all saw Wu Ren.

17
00:01:12,090 --> 00:01:13,690
It seems something happened in Ningcheng,

18
00:01:13,690 --> 00:01:16,050
and it's related to the Shisha Gang.

19
00:01:17,050 --> 00:01:20,370
Maybe Shen Tianbai and Wu Ren
are plotting something,

20
00:01:20,370 --> 00:01:21,210
or maybe...

21
00:01:22,050 --> 00:01:24,980
Shen Tianbai is a spy sent
by Wu Ren to the Shisha Gang.

22
00:01:25,050 --> 00:01:26,890
Of course, this is just a guess.

23
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:31,980
I need to find out what Shen Tianbai
is up to as soon as possible.

24
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:33,140
He is very cautious.

25
00:01:33,190 --> 00:01:34,720
I'm afraid it won't be easy.

26
00:01:35,570 --> 00:01:37,890
I'm going to put on a show tomorrow.

27
00:01:41,050 --> 00:01:42,130
I'll take a gamble.

28
00:01:51,130 --> 00:01:53,700
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 13]

29
00:02:03,450 --> 00:02:04,290
Hui.

30
00:02:05,270 --> 00:02:06,470
Where is your lackey?

31
00:02:07,030 --> 00:02:07,860
How is he?

32
00:02:08,050 --> 00:02:10,050
Is the sack comfortable to sleep in?

33
00:02:14,970 --> 00:02:16,130
Lu Ye.

34
00:02:16,160 --> 00:02:17,760
You are all alone,

35
00:02:17,910 --> 00:02:20,970
yet you dare to run wild
in our Shisha Gang's territory.

36
00:02:22,150 --> 00:02:23,470
So what if I'm alone?

37
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,440
You're a loser anyway.

38
00:02:26,010 --> 00:02:27,050
What did you say?

39
00:02:27,200 --> 00:02:30,200
I said you're a loser.

40
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:31,150
Are you deaf?

41
00:02:31,170 --> 00:02:31,530
You!

42
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,240
Lu Ye.

43
00:02:33,510 --> 00:02:35,240
You've come at me so many times,

44
00:02:35,420 --> 00:02:37,400
yet I'm still standing here
perfectly fine.

45
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:38,840
Even in your territory,

46
00:02:39,210 --> 00:02:40,810
you don't dare to make a move.

47
00:02:40,970 --> 00:02:41,730
Coward.

48
00:02:53,350 --> 00:02:54,230
You brat,

49
00:02:54,250 --> 00:02:55,410
you asked for it.

50
00:02:56,070 --> 00:02:57,190
Tianbai, let's go.

51
00:03:14,430 --> 00:03:15,950
Young Master! Young Master!

52
00:03:15,950 --> 00:03:16,750
What's wrong?

53
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:18,550
Where are you hurt?

54
00:03:18,930 --> 00:03:19,320
Young Master.

55
00:03:19,320 --> 00:03:20,040
Let's go.

56
00:03:20,090 --> 00:03:21,150
Careful, careful.

57
00:03:21,490 --> 00:03:22,050
Careful.

58
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,060
Careful.

59
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,490
Here, give it to me.

60
00:03:29,490 --> 00:03:30,370
The young master's wound is infected.

61
00:03:30,370 --> 00:03:31,360
Go get some antibiotics immediately.

62
00:03:31,360 --> 00:03:32,100
The sooner, the better!

63
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:32,410
Yes.

64
00:03:32,430 --> 00:03:33,090
Go quickly.

65
00:03:33,829 --> 00:03:34,829
[Breaking: Lu Ye Unconscious
for 24 Hours;]

66
00:03:34,829 --> 00:03:35,840
[Qingtian Gang Thrown into Chaos;
Hefty Reward for High‑effect Antibiotics]

67
00:03:36,090 --> 00:03:38,370
Thank God.

68
00:03:38,930 --> 00:03:42,210
That brat Lu Ye's wound must be infected.

69
00:03:42,930 --> 00:03:47,130
My dagger was just dipped
in the dirty water from the dock.

70
00:03:48,690 --> 00:03:52,370
He's doomed to die this time.

71
00:03:57,970 --> 00:03:58,890
Hui.

72
00:03:59,220 --> 00:04:00,380
Tell me about it.

73
00:04:01,760 --> 00:04:02,320
Here.

74
00:04:05,830 --> 00:04:07,350
You really want to know?

75
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:29,920
Let me tell you.

76
00:04:30,550 --> 00:04:34,390
If ordinary antibiotics could cure it,

77
00:04:35,350 --> 00:04:39,470
the Qingtian Gang
wouldn't go to such great lengths.

78
00:04:40,650 --> 00:04:43,530
They must use a specific medicine.

79
00:04:45,370 --> 00:04:46,370
However,

80
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:49,450
in the entire Ningcheng right now,

81
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,920
they will definitely not find it.

82
00:04:57,690 --> 00:04:58,409
Hui,

83
00:04:58,760 --> 00:04:59,520
why?

84
00:05:00,090 --> 00:05:01,090
Why?

85
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:06,040
Because the medicine
is in the boss's study.

86
00:05:07,410 --> 00:05:09,250
They would never expect it.

87
00:06:16,660 --> 00:06:19,140
Lu Ye clearly provoked Hui that day.

88
00:06:19,990 --> 00:06:21,550
Why was he so reckless?

89
00:06:22,070 --> 00:06:22,950
But what if...

90
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,480
Forget it.

91
00:06:24,940 --> 00:06:27,070
He needs this medicine without delay.

92
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:45,670
Forget it, I'll just take a look.

93
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:04,960
Oh no.

94
00:07:04,980 --> 00:07:06,020
It's a trap.

95
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,560
Guard the door well!

96
00:07:07,590 --> 00:07:08,350
-Yes!
-Yes!

97
00:07:10,020 --> 00:07:10,900
Officer Shen.

98
00:07:12,050 --> 00:07:13,130
Since you're here,

99
00:07:14,130 --> 00:07:16,060
why are you in such a hurry to leave?

100
00:07:24,970 --> 00:07:25,770
Shen Tianbai,

101
00:07:26,540 --> 00:07:28,200
you've let me go so many times.

102
00:07:29,930 --> 00:07:30,770
And...

103
00:07:34,930 --> 00:07:36,330
you still want to save me.

104
00:07:39,050 --> 00:07:42,650
You are an undercover agent sent
by the police to the Shisha Gang.

105
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:48,700
Quite an imagination you've got.

106
00:07:49,610 --> 00:07:50,409
Aren't you?

107
00:07:51,130 --> 00:07:52,790
Then why didn't you let me die?

108
00:07:52,810 --> 00:07:55,090
Is there any other reason?

109
00:07:57,370 --> 00:07:58,770
I don't want you to die.

110
00:07:59,290 --> 00:08:01,450
If you die, the Qingtian Gang
will fall apart.

111
00:08:01,450 --> 00:08:03,970
Without enemies, how can I climb?

112
00:08:06,570 --> 00:08:07,690
My apologies.

113
00:08:08,610 --> 00:08:10,470
So you have such great ambitions.

114
00:08:10,570 --> 00:08:11,890
You want to be the boss
of the Shisha Gang?

115
00:08:11,890 --> 00:08:12,690
Can't I?

116
00:08:15,330 --> 00:08:18,860
There's not a grain of truth in anything
that old guy Wu Ren says.

117
00:08:19,050 --> 00:08:22,050
He told me something happened
in Ningcheng,

118
00:08:22,410 --> 00:08:25,810
so he had to send you to the Shisha Gang
as an undercover agent.

119
00:08:26,410 --> 00:08:28,970
It seems I didn't hit him hard enough.

120
00:08:32,450 --> 00:08:33,650
Where is my master?

121
00:08:36,809 --> 00:08:37,890
You fell for it.

122
00:08:38,610 --> 00:08:39,610
I'm really sorry,

123
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:40,720
Officer Shen.

124
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,950
I lied to you again.

125
00:08:45,370 --> 00:08:46,450
You tricked me.

126
00:08:46,970 --> 00:08:47,810
Can't I?

127
00:08:51,150 --> 00:08:53,730
This was accidentally left by Wu Ren
when he went to the ferry to investigate.

128
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:56,330
I don't have the ability
to kidnap your master.

129
00:08:56,870 --> 00:08:57,790
Accidentally?

130
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:00,600
Fine.

131
00:09:00,630 --> 00:09:01,430
I admit

132
00:09:01,450 --> 00:09:04,180
I asked the people
of the Qingtian Gang to take it.

133
00:09:06,010 --> 00:09:07,340
What about your injury?

134
00:09:07,800 --> 00:09:08,760
This is true.

135
00:09:11,050 --> 00:09:12,650
Your injury is very serious,

136
00:09:13,090 --> 00:09:14,550
and your life is in danger?

137
00:09:17,010 --> 00:09:19,290
That's a little exaggerated.

138
00:09:21,010 --> 00:09:22,670
What exactly do you want to do?

139
00:09:22,730 --> 00:09:23,930
What do I want to do?

140
00:09:24,810 --> 00:09:26,070
Since you are so smart,

141
00:09:26,220 --> 00:09:26,940
don't you know?

142
00:09:26,940 --> 00:09:28,070
I don't want to know.

143
00:09:32,220 --> 00:09:35,060
My father's death
is related to the Shisha Gang.

144
00:09:35,810 --> 00:09:38,680
It's also related to the drugs
you are investigating.

145
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:40,540
I don't want to be kept in the dark.

146
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:42,400
No matter what you are doing now,

147
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:44,070
count me in.

148
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:48,650
I will help you find
the real murderer of your father.

149
00:09:48,650 --> 00:09:51,330
But you don't need
to participate in other things.

150
00:09:51,330 --> 00:09:52,130
Help?

151
00:09:52,810 --> 00:09:54,070
I want to be in the game.

152
00:09:54,290 --> 00:09:55,290
No way.

153
00:09:56,010 --> 00:09:57,530
Then don't blame me

154
00:09:58,010 --> 00:10:00,010
for telling him your little secret.

155
00:10:02,530 --> 00:10:04,590
Whether Xu Qingdao believes it or not

156
00:10:05,050 --> 00:10:06,380
doesn't really matter.

157
00:10:08,890 --> 00:10:10,370
What matters is...

158
00:10:14,170 --> 00:10:14,970
Once people

159
00:10:15,830 --> 00:10:17,270
become suspicious...

160
00:10:18,110 --> 00:10:20,510
Is this how you bite the hand
that feeds you?

161
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:26,900
Thank you for giving me
this chance to threaten you.

162
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:32,300
Why should I trust

163
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:36,480
someone like you?

164
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,880
This is my show of good faith.

165
00:10:43,780 --> 00:10:44,580
With this,

166
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:47,580
you can access
the core of the Qingtian Gang.

167
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:48,670
I promise

168
00:10:49,250 --> 00:10:51,090
I will help you climb the ranks

169
00:10:51,850 --> 00:10:53,450
until Xu Qingdao trusts you.

170
00:10:53,930 --> 00:10:54,770
By then,

171
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:57,700
we will be able
to get the answers we want.

172
00:10:58,500 --> 00:10:59,460
What do you say?

173
00:11:07,010 --> 00:11:08,810
Do you want to cooperate with me?

174
00:11:18,210 --> 00:11:19,210
I hope this time,

175
00:11:21,010 --> 00:11:22,540
you won't make me regret it.

176
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,290
Definitely not.

177
00:11:28,650 --> 00:11:29,450
What's wrong?

178
00:11:30,130 --> 00:11:31,730
I didn't even use much force.

179
00:11:32,070 --> 00:11:32,870
Shen Tianbai.

180
00:11:40,330 --> 00:11:41,130
Shen Tianbai.

181
00:11:45,310 --> 00:11:46,390
Are you poisoned?

182
00:11:48,080 --> 00:11:49,160
Xu Qingdao.

183
00:11:50,290 --> 00:11:52,150
He's controlling you with drugs.

184
00:11:52,250 --> 00:11:53,450
Xu Qingdao did this.

185
00:11:54,010 --> 00:11:54,650
Right?

186
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,860
What is the antidote for this poison?

187
00:12:11,010 --> 00:12:14,610
Xu Qingdao gives me
the antidote every 2 weeks.

188
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,720
That's a huge price to pay.

189
00:12:18,740 --> 00:12:21,000
Then we have even more reason to succeed.

190
00:12:21,360 --> 00:12:24,720
No matter what the police want to do,

191
00:12:25,070 --> 00:12:26,600
once the truth is revealed,

192
00:12:27,490 --> 00:12:29,420
I will definitely kill Xu Qingdao.

193
00:12:30,010 --> 00:12:31,930
If only it were that simple.

194
00:12:32,450 --> 00:12:35,650
Xu Qingdao is just a pawn.

195
00:12:36,570 --> 00:12:39,650
The medicine is all in the boss's study.

196
00:12:40,050 --> 00:12:41,580
It serves another purpose.

197
00:12:42,050 --> 00:12:43,410
They don't know.

198
00:12:47,350 --> 00:12:48,190
What purpose?

199
00:12:50,930 --> 00:12:52,330
What purpose?

200
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,760
Why do you care what it's for?

201
00:12:55,890 --> 00:12:59,610
Anyway, the person
above the boss needs it.

202
00:12:59,630 --> 00:13:01,430
When we send it to him,

203
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:03,680
we'll get the credit too.

204
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:09,860
Who is that person?

205
00:13:12,810 --> 00:13:14,050
That person.

206
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:18,010
He is that person.

207
00:13:22,370 --> 00:13:23,450
Behind him,

208
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:27,540
there is someone else.

209
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:29,550
What?
